  root cause  : The ad service is not running the artifact it should be. Platform-automation churned ad's image reference five times in the 51 minutes before onset — three applications of ghcr.io/open-telemetry/demo:2.2.0-ad-hotfix.2 and two reverts, the last application at 10:25:05 [tr_765348808ebd] — and ad's own log ends at ~10:25:04 with an orderly gRPC/JVM shutdown, then nothing at all: no startup banner, no further request lines [tr_61be572c8a85]. The container was recreated onto the hotfix image and did not come back. From the caller side, frontend's single errored trace path terminates at its own AdService GetAds client span, a childless leaf failing in ~0.2ms — an RPC refused at or before ad produced a span [tr_3debc72cec5a] — which explains frontend's partial ~4% mean / ~8.9% peak error ratio on one route [tr_a556759caeaa]. Neither frontend nor product-catalog has any recorded change in the window [tr_7dd5c4871cd1][tr_251454706271].
