=== PROPOSAL ===
  ABSTAINED - no permitted action fits the evidence
  if wrong    : This abstention is wrong if someone produces (a) a dispatch that resolves 172.18.0.19:9555 to a named service in the blast radius, and (b) that service's own logs or container state showing a dead or wedged process rather than a live process behind a broken route. Logs from ad showing it running and serving other peers would confirm a pure partition and keep the abstention correct; silence from ad plus a stale IP would convert this into a restart_service case against ad. Equally, if the frontend error ratio recovers while the EHOSTUNREACH lines continue, the causal chain in the verdict is wrong and the real driver is elsewhere.
  rests on    : tr_2fb5ffc9c7e7, tr_02526dd4aae4, tr_751b4dbe028b
