  if wrong    : Falsified if ad logs show startup then another shutdown or a stack trace (image genuinely bad / crashloop), or stay empty (never scheduled or pull failure — fix lies in platform-automation, outside this system, escalate), or if frontend keeps logging host-unreachable to 172.18.0.19:9555 after ad is up, meaning the port-convention attribution was wrong.
